units metal
atom_style atomic
lattice hcp 2.9






region box block 0 30 0 20 0 20

region projectile block 5.0 5.4 4.0 4.4 4.0 4.3
region boundary block 1 29 1 29 1 29
create_box 3 box
create_atoms 1 box



variable fa equal 287
variable fb equal 218
variable ft equal 2000



set type 1 type/fraction 2 $(v_fa/v_ft) 1734536
set type 2 type/fraction 3 $(v_fb/(287)) 1734535




group Ti type 1
group V type 2
group Al type 3







pair_style      hybrid/overlay eam/alloy zbl 0.5 2

pair_coeff      * * eam/alloy TiVCrAl.set   Ti V Al


pair_coeff      1 1 zbl 22 22
pair_coeff      1 2 zbl 22 23

pair_coeff      1 3 zbl 22 13
pair_coeff      2 2 zbl 23 23
pair_coeff      2 3 zbl 23 13
pair_coeff      3 3 zbl 13 13










group proj region projectile
group box region box
group host subtract box proj

group boundary region boundary
group bound subtract box boundary

timestep 0.001
velocity all create 300 79845








fix 1 all npt temp 300 300 0.25 iso 0.0 0.0 1
thermo_style custom step temp press ke pe etotal vol density
thermo 1000
run 20000
write_dump all custom dump.first.txt id type x y z
unfix 1

fix 2 all nve
timestep 0.0001

velocity proj set 26 16.9 126  units box



fix 3 bound langevin 300 300 35.0 2134

compute centro all centro/atom fcc
compute ke all ke/atom
thermo 20000
dump 11 all custom 49000 all.out id type x y z vx vy vz c_centro c_ke
dump 13 proj custom 49000 proj.out id type x y z vx vy vz c_centro c_ke
run 50000

undump 11
undump 13










